WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.135
Step 1. Open the Files tab.

1.2
00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:07.021
You can upload files from your device to a patient or to an encounter.

1.3
00:00:07.021 --> 00:00:12.197
Open the patient's page or the encounter, and select the Files tab.

2.1
00:00:12.197 --> 00:00:14.361
Step 2. Choose the files.

2.2
00:00:14.361 --> 00:00:19.719
Select Add Files, then Upload From Device, and pick one or more files.

2.3
00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:24.659
If you do not see Add Files, you cannot upload files here.

3.1
00:00:24.659 --> 00:00:30.604
Step 3. Name each file. The File Name field is required, and it starts empty.

3.2
00:00:30.604 --> 00:00:35.616
Care does not copy the name that the file has on your device.

4.1
00:00:35.616 --> 00:00:38.719
Step 5. Upload the files. Select Upload.

4.2
00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:43.782
Care shows the progress while it uploads the files one after the other,

4.3
00:00:43.782 --> 00:00:47.847
and you cannot close the dialog until it finishes.
